_combo.png", "id": "1429374239243152", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673511715_1429374242576485_7918803285572016121_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_KUctch4MYUQ7kNvwGySERS&_nc_oc=Adp5LR-og9YH23zF5EsD68YA1uqvIEGSsVNWnP5Io7WcEfaP8S_vQ-g5n1yjOBmsxEw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQLfRCxZzEKCgLyiUYpllMifLUb3Grkg-jRFybCpU7Yg&oe=6AFF23E0"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_2_cosmic_bonus.png", "id": "2889459538075045", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623601_2889459541408378_27470634086670177_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c0JxRltyoaoQ7kNvwEphjsZ&_nc_oc=AdpPNCMYFyFTV332jK35zpywGvL9QCNmEEThUvhjyedWGJJ0uccgb0dl8s6U5rcChyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTj8dNmL8gM0oQSWd09HpzHHngbs2x5PwiWxpMZJHMT1Q&oe=6AFF320A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "kaba-.png", "id": "1017087634269916", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_1017087637603249_7789973402206879076_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d1qYd8tC6JQQ7kNvwHhIF6P&_nc_oc=AdrkgthySbJDZpe1jGlV2Hkh3EQdPXrp_kixVcCq05BajdQAUO7Qj8pHtGCkD48w5Ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSsT71dATPWAs6V-PKP5tPfYyISY3Kvmpg-2I4LkYSevw&oe=6AFF2A01"}, "display_name": "Sock Cactus \u2014 Rhythm Ritual", "keywords": ["rhythm", "shooter", "music", "surrealism", "psychedelic"], "long_description": "A sweet fusion of surrealism, Buddhism, and rhythm shooting.\n\nEnter the zone and relive your life flashing before your eyes \u2014 on a roller coaster!\n\nTo the beat, capture the sock-fruits ripening on cacti with a dual-wielding, healing cyber-mokugyo (wooden fish)!\n\nPeek at fragments of memory hidden inside each sock-fruit \u2014 and revisit the ones you've found in the encyclopedia!\n\nVR trip packed with vaporwave, surrealism, Japanese local culture, and a homage to American Surrealism\u2026", "short_description": "A surreal Buddhist rhythm rail-shooter. To the beat, blast the sock-fruits ripening on cacti with dual-wielding healing cyber-mokugyo, while a roller coaster carries you through your life flashing before your eyes. Vaporwave, surrealism, Japanese local culture, and a homage to American Surrealism \u2014 a strangely addictive VR trip."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1037598518885407", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Sock Cactus \u2014 Rhythm Ritual", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u30b7\u30e5\u30eb\u30ec\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u30e0\u3068\u4ecf\u6559\u3068\u30ea\u30ba\u30e0\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u7518\u3044\u878d\u5408\u3002\n\n\u30be\u30fc\u30f3\u306b\u5165\u308a\u3001\u8d70\u99ac\u706f\u3092\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u30b3\u30fc\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u3067\u8ffd\u4f53\u9a13\uff01\n\n\u30ea\u30ba\u30e0\u306b\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3001\u30b5\u30dc\u30c6\u30f3\u306b\u307f\u306e\u308b\u9774\u4e0b\u306e\u5b9f\u3092\u3001\u4e8c\u4e01\u62f3\u9283\u30b9\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u306e\u7652\u3057\u30b5\u30a4\u30d0\u30fc\u6728\u9b5a\u3067\u6355\u7372\u3060\uff01\n\n\u9774\u4e0b\u306e\u5b9f\u304b\u3089\u8a18\u61b6\u306e\u65ad\u7247\u3092\u8997\u304d\u898b\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3057\u3001\u30b2\u30c3\u30c8\u3057\u305f\u65ad\u7247\u306f\u56f3\u9451\u304b\u3089\u78ba\u8a8d\u3082\u3067\u304d\u308b\uff01\n\n\u30f4\u30a7\u30a4\u30d1\u30fc\u30a6\u30a7\u30a3\u30d6\u3068\u30b7\u30e5\u30eb\u30ec\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u30e0\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30eb\u30ab\u30eb\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u30a2\u30e1\u30ea\u30ab\u30f3\u30b7\u30e5\u30eb\u30ec\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u30e0\u306e\u30aa\u30de\u30fc\u30b8\u30e5\u304c\u8a70\u307e\u3063\u305f\u6fc3\u539a\u306aVR\u4f53\u9a13\u2026\n\n\u3048\uff1f\u4f55\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u308b\u304b\u308f\u304b\u3089